    "detailed_description": "Pizza Delivery Survivors<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience the thrill of pizza delivery in a zombie apocalypse! In &quot;Pizza Delivery Survivors,&quot; you are a pizza delivery driver navigating a city overrun by zombies. This game offers a unique blend of survival, strategy, and fast-paced action. Deliver pizzas, outsmart the undead, and survive in a world where your daily job becomes a fight for survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDynamic Gameplay: Engage in high-intensity pizza delivery missions while dodging and outwitting hordes of zombies. Every delivery is a thrilling adventure of survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExpansive Arsenal of Weapons:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMop: Turn your trusty cleaning tool into a makeshift weapon against zombies.<br />\r\nPizza Wheel: Slice through zombie crowds with this culinary tool.<br />\r\nUnlimited Breadsticks Basket: Shoot breadsticks at high speed to fend off the undead.<br />\r\nCheese Shakers: Shake some cheese in the hordes of faces.<br />\r\nOven Drop: Deploy ovens from above for a smashing impact.<br />\r\nBroken Pizza Sign: Electrify zombies with this unexpectedly potent weapon.<br />\r\nFuture Development Plans:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInteractive Environment for Item Spawns: Discover objects in the game world, like abandoned cars and fire hydrants, that players can interact with to find useful items or uncover hidden secrets.<br />\r\nSynergistic Weapon Upgrades: Enhance your arsenal with new weapons and upgrades that create dynamic synergies between existing weapons.<br />\r\nDelivery Encounters System: Engage in meaningful interactions with customers during deliveries, with choices affecting outcomes and branching the story.<br />\r\nNight Shift Mode: Tackle more challenging missions in remote or complex locations with unique enemy behaviors.<br />\r\nNew Cities and Day Shifts: Unlock new environments with distinct challenges by achieving specific in-game goals.<br />\r\nEnhanced Player Progression: Gain additional health upgrades and abilities, allowing for more tailored survival strategies.",
    "about_the_game": "Pizza Delivery Survivors<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExperience the thrill of pizza delivery in a zombie apocalypse! In &quot;Pizza Delivery Survivors,&quot; you are a pizza delivery driver navigating a city overrun by zombies. This game offers a unique blend of survival, strategy, and fast-paced action. Deliver pizzas, outsmart the undead, and survive in a world where your daily job becomes a fight for survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nKey Features:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nDynamic Gameplay: Engage in high-intensity pizza delivery missions while dodging and outwitting hordes of zombies. Every delivery is a thrilling adventure of survival.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nExpansive Arsenal of Weapons:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMop: Turn your trusty cleaning tool into a makeshift weapon against zombies.<br />\r\nPizza Wheel: Slice through zombie crowds with this culinary tool.<br />\r\nUnlimited Breadsticks Basket: Shoot breadsticks at high speed to fend off the undead.<br />\r\nCheese Shakers: Shake some cheese in the hordes of faces.<br />\r\nOven Drop: Deploy ovens from above for a smashing impact.<br />\r\nBroken Pizza Sign: Electrify zombies with this unexpectedly potent weapon.<br />\r\nFuture Development Plans:<br />\r\n<br />\r\nInteractive Environment for Item Spawns: Discover objects in the game world, like abandoned cars and fire hydrants, that players can interact with to find useful items or uncover hidden secrets.<br />\r\nSynergistic Weapon Upgrades: Enhance your arsenal with new weapons and upgrades that create dynamic synergies between existing weapons.<br />\r\nDelivery Encounters System: Engage in meaningful interactions with customers during deliveries, with choices affecting outcomes and branching the story.<br />\r\nNight Shift Mode: Tackle more challenging missions in remote or complex locations with unique enemy behaviors.<br />\r\nNew Cities and Day Shifts: Unlock new environments with distinct challenges by achieving specific in-game goals.<br />\r\nEnhanced 